# Platform code must list users only through platform.listable_users (the all-zero system user is excluded there). The fault adds a non-test Go file under internal/ that selects
# from public.users directly; the gate must name the file and the line. The control side is the real repository, which must be green.
GATE=user-lists
TARGET=platform
SETUP=
STEP=check-user-lists on the real repository
CMD=bash scripts/check-user-lists.sh
MESSAGE=internal/app/zz_userlist.go:4: SELECT from public.users
MESSAGE=check-user-lists: RED
